        <p class="description">02 / UI Design</p>

        <h2>Designing the Experience</h2>

        <p>
          As one of two UI Designers, I co-created Eleganza’s design system, establishing a visual language that balances the elegance of classical music with clear and usable web interfaces.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <h3>Visual Direction</h3>
          <p>
            We combined serif typography for headings and brand elements with sans-serif body text, using low-saturation violin wood tones and grayscale colors to create a refined and cohesive visual identity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <h3>Responsive Components</h3>
          <p>
            I led the design of the header and footer across desktop and mobile, and designed responsive layouts for the homepage, teacher, and lesson pages.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <h3>Design System</h3>
          <p>
            The system defined typography, color, logo treatment, and reusable component states such as buttons, helping maintain consistency across the website.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Design system -->
