      <!-- Left: Story + Explanation -->
      <div class="col-md-5">
        <p class="description">04 / Technical Architecture</p>

        <h2>Connecting interface, logic, and data</h2>

        <p>
          The site connects a responsive frontend with backend routes and a structured SQL database, allowing product, class, account, cart, and order data to flow across the experience.

I worked across the interface and data layer, connecting SQL queries and backend routes to the frontend to support core e-commerce and account features.
        </p>

